@startuml LLM_DPECI_End_to_End_Sequence
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", "Helvetica", "Arial", sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam boxPadding 10
skinparam participantPadding 15

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C3E50
    ArrowThickness 1.2
    ActorBorderColor #2C3E50
    ActorBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
    LifeLineBorderColor #7F8C8D
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #BDC3C7
    ParticipantBorderColor #34495E
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
    ParticipantFontSize 12
    ParticipantFontStyle bold
    GroupBorderColor #7F8C8D
    GroupBackgroundColor #F8F9F9
    GroupHeaderFontStyle bold
    NoteBorderColor #BDC3C7
    NoteBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
}

title **LLM-Powered Dynamic Pricing Engine with Causal Inference (LLM-DPECI)**\n== End-to-End System Interaction & Decision Sequence ==

actor "Pricing Manager\n(Business User)" as User #E8F8F5
boundary "React 19 Frontend\n(RealDataWorkspace)" as UI #EBF5FB
control "FastAPI Gateway\n(Routes & Auth)" as API #E8F6F3
entity "Dataset Validator\n& Ingestion" as Ingestion #FEF5E7
entity "Feature Engineering\n& Panel Builder" as Features #F4ECF7
entity "Causal Engine\n(DoWhy + LinearDML)" as Causal #FDEDEC
entity "Bayesian Optimizer\n(skopt GP-Minimize)" as Optimizer #EAF2F8
database "Relational DB\n(SQLite / PostgreSQL)" as DB #EAEDED
database "Vector Evidence Store\n(LangChain + Embeddings)" as RAG #FCF3CF
control "Google Gemini LLM\n(GenAI Grounded RAG)" as LLM #F5EEF8

autonumber 1 "<b>[00]</b>"

== PHASE 1: Dataset Upload, Validation & Tenant Ingestion ==

User -> UI: Uploads historical sales CSV\n(date, SKU, price, units_sold, unit_cost)
activate UI

UI -> API: POST /api/v1/datasets/validate\n(Multipart CSV + column mapping)
activate API

API -> Ingestion: validate_dataset_csv(content, filename, mapping)
activate Ingestion
Ingestion -> Ingestion: Check missing values, types, non-negativity,\nand price variation (nunique(price) >= 2)
Ingestion --> API: Return DatasetQualityReport\n(valid_rows, invalid_rows, column_summary)
deactivate Ingestion

API --> UI: 200 OK (DatasetQualityReport)
deactivate API

User -> UI: Confirms & commits dataset upload
UI -> API: POST /api/v1/datasets/retailers/{retailer_id}\n(CSV + mapping_json)
activate API

API -> Ingestion: persist_validated_dataset(db, retailer, content)
activate Ingestion
Ingestion -> DB: Insert DatasetUpload, Product SKUs,\nand canonical SalesObservation records
activate DB
DB --> Ingestion: Commit confirmation
deactivate DB

Ingestion -> RAG: add_dataset_evidence(dataset_metadata)
activate RAG
RAG -> DB: Save EvidenceDocument(source_type="dataset_quality")
activate DB
DB --> RAG: Stored
deactivate DB
RAG --> Ingestion: Vector indexed
deactivate RAG

Ingestion --> API: DatasetUploadRead
deactivate Ingestion

API --> UI: 201 Created (Dataset Upload Details)
UI --> User: Display dataset stats, catalog SKUs & quality metrics
deactivate UI

== PHASE 2: Feature Engineering & Causal Estimation (DoWhy + EconML) ==

User -> UI: Selects Product SKU & clicks "Run Causal Analysis"
activate UI

UI -> API: POST /api/v1/retailers/{id}/products/{sku}/causal-runs?async_mode=true
activate API

API -> DB: Query SalesObservation history for SKU
activate DB
DB --> API: Return raw transaction records
deactivate DB

API -> DB: Create ModelRun(status="queued", progress_step="Queued")
activate DB
DB --> API: ModelRun ID created
deactivate DB

API -> API: Enqueue background task (_execute_causal_job)
API --> UI: 201 Created (ModelRun queued)
deactivate API

note over UI, API
  Frontend initiates asynchronous polling:
  GET /api/v1/retailers/{id}/products/{sku}/causal-runs/{run_id}
  every 2000ms until status is terminal.
end note

group Async Background Worker Execution
    API -> Features: build_product_panel(db, product_id)
    activate Features
    Features -> Features: Daily aggregation, calendar seasonality,\nlagged demand, promotional indicators
    Features --> API: ProductPanel(frame, confounders, eligible)
    deactivate Features

    alt Product ineligible (insufficient observations < 30 or no price variation)
        API -> DB: Update ModelRun(status="blocked", limitations)
        API -> RAG: add_causal_evidence(blocked_run)
    else Product eligible for causal inference
        API -> Causal: estimate_price_effect(panel.frame, confounders)
        activate Causal
        
        Causal -> Causal: 1. Separate Treatment Modifiers (X)\nfrom Common Causes (W)
        Causal -> Causal: 2. DoWhy: CausalModel identification\n(Backdoor criterion)
        Causal -> Causal: 3. EconML: LinearDML with 3-Fold Cross-Fitting\n(RandomForest for Y & T residualization)
        Causal -> Causal: 4. Compute ATE, 95% CI [lower, upper],\nand segment-specific heterogeneous elasticities
        
        group Robustness Refutation Battery (Safety Gates)
            Causal -> Causal: Refuter 1: Placebo Treatment (permute prices)
            Causal -> Causal: Refuter 2: Random Common Cause (+ random confounder)
            Causal -> Causal: Refuter 3: Data Subset Stability (80% subsample)
        end
        
        Causal --> API: CausalEstimate(effect, ci_lower, ci_upper, diagnostics)
        deactivate Causal

        API -> DB: Update ModelRun(status="completed", diagnostics, effect, CI)
        activate DB
        DB --> API: Updated
        deactivate DB

        API -> RAG: add_causal_evidence(completed_run)
        activate RAG
        RAG -> DB: Save EvidenceDocument(source_type="causal_diagnostics")
        activate DB
        DB --> RAG: Stored
        deactivate DB
        RAG --> API: Vector snapshot saved
        deactivate RAG
    end
end

UI -> API: GET /api/v1/retailers/{id}/products/{sku}/causal-runs/{run_id}
activate API
API -> DB: Fetch latest ModelRun state
activate DB
DB --> API: Return ModelRun
deactivate DB
API --> UI: 200 OK (status="completed", elasticity, CI, diagnostics)
deactivate API

UI --> User: Display causal elasticity, 95% CI, and refutation test badges
deactivate UI

== PHASE 3: Constrained Bayesian Profit Optimization (skopt GP-Minimize) ==

User -> UI: Inputs constraints:\n(min_margin=15%, max_incr=20%, max_decr=20%, comp_proximity)
activate UI
User -> UI: Clicks "Optimize Price"

UI -> API: POST /api/v1/retailers/{id}/products/{sku}/model-runs/{run_id}/recommendations\n(constraints payload)
activate API

API -> DB: Fetch ModelRun & latest SalesObservation
activate DB
DB --> API: ModelRun + SalesObservation (price, cost, demand)
deactivate DB

group Safety Validation Gate
    API -> API: Verify: 1. ModelRun status == "completed"\n2. All 3 refutation tests PASSED\n3. CI_upper < 0 (confidently downward-sloping)
    alt Diagnostics failed OR CI_upper >= 0
        API --> UI: 409 Conflict: "Causal diagnostics did not pass;\nprice optimization is blocked."
    end
end

API -> Optimizer: optimize_price(price, demand, cost, effect, constraints)
activate Optimizer

Optimizer -> Optimizer: Calculate Margin Floor: UnitCost / (1 - min_margin)
Optimizer -> Optimizer: Calculate Allowed Bounds [lower_bound, upper_bound]\nincorporating competitor price floor
Optimizer -> Optimizer: Define Causal Expected Demand:\nD(P) = D0 + beta_causal * (P - P0)
Optimizer -> Optimizer: Formulate Objective:\nMaximize Profit(P) = (P - UnitCost) * D(P)
Optimizer -> Optimizer: Run Bayesian Gaussian Process:\ngp_minimize(-profit, bounds, n_calls=30)

Optimizer --> API: OptimizationResult(optimal_price, expected_profit, expected_demand)
deactivate Optimizer

API -> DB: Insert Recommendation record
activate DB
DB --> API: Recommendation ID saved
deactivate DB

API -> RAG: add_recommendation_evidence(recommendation)
activate RAG
RAG -> DB: Save EvidenceDocument(source_type="pricing_recommendation")
activate DB
DB --> RAG: Stored
deactivate DB
RAG --> API: Vector snapshot saved
deactivate RAG

API --> UI: 201 Created (RecommendationRead)
deactivate API

UI --> User: Displays Recommended Price, Expected Demand Lift, and Projected Profit
deactivate UI

== PHASE 4: Price Deployment & Audit Trail Recording ==

User -> UI: Reviews recommendation & clicks "Apply to Catalog"
activate UI

UI -> API: POST /api/v1/retailers/{id}/products/{sku}/recommendations/{rec_id}/apply
activate API

API -> DB: Update Recommendation(is_applied=True, applied_at=NOW)
activate DB
DB --> API: Updated
deactivate DB

API -> DB: Insert EvidenceDocument(source_type="applied_price", audit_metadata)
activate DB
DB --> API: Audit Trail committed
deactivate DB

API --> UI: 200 OK (RecommendationRead with applied status)
deactivate API

UI -> UI: Refresh Catalog status badge to "Active Price Deployed"
UI --> User: Confirms deployment of recommended price to production catalog
deactivate UI

== PHASE 5: Grounded Evidence Retrieval & Gemini LLM Executive Report ==

User -> UI: Asks executive question:\n"Explain verified pricing evidence and safety rationale"
activate UI

UI -> API: POST /api/v1/retailers/{id}/products/{sku}/reports/generate\n(question payload)
activate API

API -> RAG: retrieve_evidence(retailer_id, product_id, question)
activate RAG
RAG -> DB: Query EvidenceDocuments for Tenant & SKU
activate DB
DB --> RAG: Dataset, Causal Run, Recommendation & Deployment records
deactivate DB

RAG -> RAG: Perform Semantic Vector Search (Gemini Embeddings or TF-IDF)\nScore & rank top relevant evidence documents
RAG --> API: Return list[RetrievedEvidence]
deactivate RAG

alt Gemini API Key Available
    API -> LLM: generate_gemini_report(question, verified_evidence)
    activate LLM
    note over API, LLM
      Prompt injects strictly retrieved verified evidence.
      Rules:
      - Plain text headings: Summary, Evidence, Recommendation status, Limitations
      - ZERO price invention, ZERO external math calculation
      - Explicitly flag any failed diagnostic or missing recommendation
    end note
    LLM --> API: Structured Executive Briefing text
    deactivate LLM
    API --> UI: 200 OK (report_type="gemini_grounded_report", answer, sources)
else API Unavailable / Network Offline (Fallback Mode)
    API -> API: build_grounded_preview(verified_evidence)\n(Deterministic template synthesis)
    API --> UI: 200 OK (report_type="deterministic_audit_fallback", answer, sources)
end
deactivate API

UI --> User: Renders Executive Report with verified citations, confidence intervals,\nand audit lineage badges
deactivate UI

@enduml
